      "value": "I like that. It kinda autofills for me if I click into the rows on the report website except the person you want to report but to have this with the person that you report would be really helpful. Or yeah...like you said the user ID.\n\nSometimes they have really annoying names with weird symbols that I can't type down.\n\nI always need to go into the output logs to catch that name.\n\nI hope this will be improved in the future",
