  "details": "Problem:\n\nThe new report system is not as instant as the old report system.\n\nCurrent process:\n\nIt takes you to a support page, where you have to fill in the information manually, which can take potentially up to ten minutes.\n\nHow to improve:\n\n-When you click on a profile to report, the Moderation Report ticket should already be selected.\n\n-Your VRChat email and username should autofill, since you're already signed into your account.\n\n-It should also autofill the username or the user ID of the person you're reporting.\n\n-If VRChat can open up the folder to your player logs via the Debug settings page, VRChat should automatically collect them and submit them in the report ticket.\n\nSimply put, the only things that should be manually input are the subject, a brief description or body of why you're reporting the user, and optionally, video or screenshot evidence.",
